{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>When you go out to war.</b> Scripture speaks of an optional war, for in a war of the land of Israel one cannot say ״and you take captives,״ since it was already stated (Deuteronomy 20): ״you shall not let any soul live.״" "<b>And you take captives.</b> To include Canaanites who are among them, even though they are of the seven nations. (Sifrei; Sotah 35)"], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:47:51.571398616Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}